stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: create (version 1)
  draft --> draft: edit (new immutable version)
  draft --> in_review: submit (formula must validate)
  in_review --> approved: approve (reviewer, not the author)
  in_review --> draft: reject (comment required)
  approved --> published: publish (one live definition per key)
  published --> draft: edit (new draft version, previous version stays live)
  published --> deprecated: deprecate
  approved --> deprecated: deprecate
  draft --> deprecated: delete (soft)
  published --> published: rollback creates a NEW version that becomes live
  deprecated --> [*]
  note right of published
    is_live = true
    unique index (workspace, key) WHERE is_live
  end note
